Description: Professional, creative-first desktop Digital Audio Workstation
 ARCLINE is a native desktop DAW built with C++20 and JUCE.
 Features a Logic Pro X-inspired dark graphite interface, sample-accurate
 arrangement, MIDI piano roll, dual channel strip inspector, and durable
 crash-resilient project management.
 Shape Your Sound.
